Subject: [PATCH 1259/3799] soh: rename func_808E1EB4 ->
 BossGanon_GatheringMagic_Update

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the update for the remaining children (params 0x64 and the ten spawned as 0xC8 + i): each flies out, then homes on the parent's hand position while recording a fifteen-point trail, and the 0xC8 group bursts into 150 particles with the thunder sfx on arrival. Named for that converging behaviour, since the effect is never named in the file.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon/z_boss_ganon.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
